# 8-Bit Full Adder

This project implements an **8-Bit Full Adder using VHDL**.

The circuit is built using **eight 1-Bit Full Adders** connected in a ripple-carry structure.

### Features
- 8-bit binary addition
- Carry-in (`Cin`)
- 8-bit Sum output
- Carry-out (`Cout`)
- Includes a VHDL testbench

### Files
- `FULL_ADDER_8BIT.vhd` – 8-Bit Full Adder
- `FULL_ADDER_8BIT_TB.vhd` – Testbench

### Tool
- Xilinx ISE
- VHDL
